    question: 'How do you observe WorkManager work status and progress from a Compose UI?',
    options: ['WorkManager does not support status observation', 'Use WorkManager.getWorkInfoByIdLiveData() or getWorkInfoByIdFlow() and collect/observe in the composable. Workers report progress via setProgress(Data) which is observable in real-time.', 'Read the status from SharedPreferences', 'Poll the work status in a loop'],
